    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006670/extras/34207b963b0ce6597c1c15e54232b286.avif?t=1726602403\" width=600 height=75 /></span><br>BomberHit\u2122: Ready for Fun with Tactical Explosions?<br><br>BomberHit\u2122 is an exciting strategy game filled with explosive action! Create your own map, set up your room, and compete with friends or online players. Gain more bomb abilities, slow running, and other strategic skills throughout the game, but be careful\u2014your opponents will be waiting for you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br>1. <strong>Create Your Own Map</strong>: Craft your unique map and design your explosive adventure just the way you like it.<br><br>2. <strong>Room Setup and Customization</strong>: Personalize your gaming experience! Set up rooms, matchmaking settings, map selection, and item adjustments to suit your preferences.<br><br>3. <strong>Strategic Abilities</strong>: Gain more bomb abilities, control your speed, and utilize other strategic skills during the game. But remember, your opponents will have the same abilities!<br><br>4. <strong>Character Customization</strong>: Personalize your character! Reflect your style with different outfits and achieve a unique look.<br><br>5. <strong>Chat with Friends</strong>: Stay in touch with friends during the game and share your strategies.<br><br>6. <strong>Online and Local Play</strong>: Play online or locally with 2 to 4 players and compete with friends or players from around the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006670/extras/9db088755b55135f19a6990c2d0886bc.avif?t=1726602403\" width=600 height=75 /></span>[/url]<br><strong>Join our Discord channel now to stay updated on our events and giveaways!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006670/extras/6b633fb477862a12a1600e507d0b9588.avif?t=1726602403\" width=600 height=74 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006670/extras/34207b963b0ce6597c1c15e54232b286.avif?t=1726602403\" width=600 height=75 /></span><br>BomberHit\u2122: Ready for Fun with Tactical Explosions?<br><br>BomberHit\u2122 is an exciting strategy game filled with explosive action! Create your own map, set up your room, and compete with friends or online players. Gain more bomb abilities, slow running, and other strategic skills throughout the game, but be careful\u2014your opponents will be waiting for you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br>1. <strong>Create Your Own Map</strong>: Craft your unique map and design your explosive adventure just the way you like it.<br><br>2. <strong>Room Setup and Customization</strong>: Personalize your gaming experience! Set up rooms, matchmaking settings, map selection, and item adjustments to suit your preferences.<br><br>3. <strong>Strategic Abilities</strong>: Gain more bomb abilities, control your speed, and utilize other strategic skills during the game. But remember, your opponents will have the same abilities!<br><br>4. <strong>Character Customization</strong>: Personalize your character! Reflect your style with different outfits and achieve a unique look.<br><br>5. <strong>Chat with Friends</strong>: Stay in touch with friends during the game and share your strategies.<br><br>6. <strong>Online and Local Play</strong>: Play online or locally with 2 to 4 players and compete with friends or players from around the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006670/extras/9db088755b55135f19a6990c2d0886bc.avif?t=1726602403\" width=600 height=75 /></span>[/url]<br><strong>Join our Discord channel now to stay updated on our events and giveaways!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.aka